# Directories: back and forward through where you have been (Alt-Left and Alt-Right at
# a real keyboard; here Ctrl-O and Ctrl-], bound to the same builtins in demo.bashrc,
# since VHS cannot press Alt with an arrow), the z jump, and Alt-E's picker.
Output directories.gif
Require cash
Source "_settings.tape"

Type "cd src"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "cd ../logs"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "cd ../../notes"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "cd ../photos"
Enter
Sleep 900ms
Ctrl+O
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+O
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+O
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+]
Sleep 900ms
Type "pwd"
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Type "z photos"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "pwd"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "cd .."
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Alt+e
Sleep 1500ms
Type@150ms "src"
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "pwd"
Enter
Sleep 2000ms
